diff --git a/docs/v2/03B-C2-REMOTE-SYNC-IMPLEMENTATION.md b/docs/v2/03B-C2-REMOTE-SYNC-IMPLEMENTATION.md
--- a/docs/v2/03B-C2-REMOTE-SYNC-IMPLEMENTATION.md
+++ b/docs/v2/03B-C2-REMOTE-SYNC-IMPLEMENTATION.md
@@
+Accepted inventory reconciliation is one Dexie transaction: canonical movement, canonical balance, `status = succeeded`, receipt, and `reconciled_at` commit together. A lost response is recovered from an incremental matching movement UUID.
+
+A received stock-count `no_change` stores a durable local observation, not a server movement receipt. Metadata stale-version recognition uses semantic numeric comparison for threshold/price fields. Ambiguous legacy rows remain unowned, and only ownership-proven legacy products are protected from authoritative pull deletion.
